    "rationale": "Manual validation only; scripts could not be run in this environment. Present design has no declared or verified preventive limits on retries, runtime, delegation depth, spend, or quota isolation. The highest present risk is a property finding on runaway spend and shared quota exhaustion affecting other teams, so inherent, residual, and forecast all remain critical. The control whose absence most drives the forecast is a hard structural spend and step limit on cap.enrich_lookup and cap.spawn_researcher."
